Great Expectations | is_a=novel | author=Charles Dickens
War and Peace | is_a=novel | author=Leo Tolstoy | located_in=Russia
Crime and Punishment | is_a=novel | author=Fyodor Dostoevsky | located_in=Russia
Things Fall Apart | is_a=novel | author=Chinua Achebe | located_in=Nigeria
One Hundred Years of Solitude | is_a=novel | author=Gabriel Garcia Marquez | is_a=work of magical realism
Nineteen Eighty-Four | is_a=novel | author=George Orwell | is_a=dystopian novel
Gitanjali | is_a=poetry collection | author=Rabindranath Tagore | located_in=India
Canterbury Tales | is_a=collection of stories | author=Geoffrey Chaucer
Homer | is_a=poet | located_in=Ancient Greece
Dante Alighieri | is_a=poet | birthplace=Florence
